    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put your skills to the test in over 100 unique levels of precision-filled chaos.</strong><i> Time Management</i>\u00a0combines features like tight corridors, unique mechanics, and\u00a0<strong>TIME</strong>\u00a0to push your abilities and sometimes... test your patience. In some areas you'll find yourself rushing at breakneck speed to finish a level, while in others a slow, calculated approach is far safer. Play the game how you'd like, but make no mistake. It's not easy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls/Death Walls - Blocks out the levels you'll push through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turrets - Weave through an abundance of bullets to reach your goal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash Tokens - Fly through danger untouched</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play/Pause Tokens - Stop and start time at will</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus/Minus Tokens - Add and subtract precious seconds to outlast the clock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Compatibility - Play how you want to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Flair - Customize your character's color</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built From The Ground Up - Every pixel, sound, and track was built for this game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen Mode - Practice levels at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TIME</strong>\u00a0- It's perhaps your biggest threat, just don't let it run out</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put your skills to the test in over 100 unique levels of precision-filled chaos.</strong><i> Time Management</i>\u00a0combines features like tight corridors, unique mechanics, and\u00a0<strong>TIME</strong>\u00a0to push your abilities and sometimes... test your patience. In some areas you'll find yourself rushing at breakneck speed to finish a level, while in others a slow, calculated approach is far safer. Play the game how you'd like, but make no mistake. It's not easy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls/Death Walls - Blocks out the levels you'll push through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turrets - Weave through an abundance of bullets to reach your goal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash Tokens - Fly through danger untouched</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play/Pause Tokens - Stop and start time at will</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus/Minus Tokens - Add and subtract precious seconds to outlast the clock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Compatibility - Play how you want to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Flair - Customize your character's color</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built From The Ground Up - Every pixel, sound, and track was built for this game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen Mode - Practice levels at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TIME</strong>\u00a0- It's perhaps your biggest threat, just don't let it run out</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
